<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-David Jones half year profit slumps.</title>
<headline>RTRS-David Jones half year profit slumps.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1996-03-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to January 25</p>
<p>		 (million A$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Operating profit		    34.79 vs 58.27</p>
<p>    Net				     22.34 vs 44.64</p>
<p>    Dividend (cents)		     4.0  vs 6.0</p>
<p>NOTE: David Jones Ltd is a department store retailer that listed on the Australian Stocks Exchange in November 1995.  </p>
<p>    Sales				  782.58 vs 790.31</p>
<p>    Other income			  23.25 vs 24.09</p>
<p>    Shr (cents)			    6.0  vs 12.0</p>
<p>    Abnormal items			 nil vs nil</p>
<p>Dividend is 100 percent franked</p>
<p>Pay date July 9</p>
<p>Reg date June 18</p>
<p>    Tax				     12.46 vs 13.64</p>
<p>    Interest				11.07 vs  5.62</p>
<p>    Depreciation			  16.01 vs 12.86</p>
<p>-- Sydney Newsroom 61-2 9373-1800</p>
